ed viewing experience.\n---------\n🌍 Multi-language support\n\nThe macro includes built-in translations (79 languages) and automatically detects which language to use.\nIf your language is missing, simply add it to the \"langs: variable and set the correct key in \"currentLang\".\n---------\n🎯 What the macro does during ads:\n\n- Mutes the sound\n- Skip all skippable ads\n\nWorks with both full-length videos and YouTube Shorts.\n---------\n⚙️ Required settings\n\n⚠️ To ensure proper functionality:\n1. Go to Android Settings -\u003e Accessibility\n2. Enable MacroDroid - UI Interaction\n\n⚠️ During operation, the macro temporarily increases the screen-reading frequency for more accurate element detection and then automatically restores the default value.\n---------\n🙌 Credits\nBased on the idea from W!lloO - YouTube: Auto skip ads:\nhttps://www.macrodroidlink.com/macrostore?id\u003d383","m_descriptionOpen":false,"m_enabled":true,"m_excludeLog":false,"m_headingColor":0,"m_isOrCondition":false,"m_name":"AutoSkip YouTube Ads ⏩","m_triggerList":[{"color":-1,"label":"Regular video","disableLogging":false,"m_SIGUID":-6554194299538392693,"m_classType":"SeparatorTrigger","m_comment":"","m_constraintList":[],"m_isDisabled":false,"m_isOrCondition":false},{"activityEnableRegex":false,"activityIgnoreCase":true,"activityNameToMatch":"","appNameList":["YouTube"],"enableRegex":false,"ignoreCase":true,"includeOverlays":false,"isOffScreen":false,"limitToActivity":false,"matchOption":0,"packageNameList":["com.google.android.youtube"],"textToMatch":"{lv\u003dlangs[{lv\u003dcurrentLang}][Visit advertiser]}*","disableLogging":false,"m_SIGUID":-8485181191588793680,"m_classType":"ScreenContentTrigger","m_comment":"","m_constraintList":[{"m_musicActive":true,"disableLogging":false,"m_SIGUID":-8465475493142843064,"m_classType":"MusicActiveConstraint","m_comment":"","m_constraintList":[],"m_isDisabled":false,"m_isOrCondition":false},{"m_active":true,"m_applicationNameList":["YouTube"],"m_foreg